From 7f4cbc9799ef1b49607d3af3a6ae86df7082e0ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Blot <emmanuel.blot@free.fr>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 14:24:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 628/705] docs/system/arm/aspeed: add the sanmiguel-bmc machine

The Facebook SanMiguel BMC machine is supported by hw/arm but has never
been listed in the Aspeed documentation. Add it to the AST2600 machine
table.

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Blot <emmanuel.blot@free.fr>
---
 docs/system/arm/aspeed.rst | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/docs/system/arm/aspeed.rst b/docs/system/arm/aspeed.rst
index e8c25bdd34..28a9881beb 100644
--- a/docs/system/arm/aspeed.rst
+++ b/docs/system/arm/aspeed.rst
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@ AST2600 SoC based machines :
 - ``bletchley-bmc``        Facebook Bletchley BMC
 - ``fby35-bmc``            Facebook fby35 BMC
 - ``catalina-bmc``         Facebook Catalina BMC
+- ``sanmiguel-bmc``        Facebook SanMiguel BMC
 - ``anacapa-bmc``          Facebook Anacapa BMC
 - ``gb200nvl-bmc``         Nvidia GB200nvl BMC
 
